@ pokeemerald data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc: LilycoveCity_Text_ContestHallInTown
Hoenn_LilycoveCity_Text_ContestHallInTown::
	.string "There's a POKéMON CONTEST HALL\n"
	.string "right in this here town. \p"
	.string "That means well-raised POKéMON will\n"
	.string "come from all over the country.\p"
	.string "My heart swells with excitement!$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc: LilycoveCity_Text_ImFromKanto
Hoenn_LilycoveCity_Text_ImFromKanto::
	.string "I came from KANTO.\p"
	.string "The HOENN region is beautiful with\n"
	.string "all its water and verdant nature.\p"
	.string "Hunh? Wait a second…\p"
	.string "Could there be rare POKéMON that live\n"
	.string "only in this area?$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc: LilycoveCity_Text_ImArtDealer
Hoenn_LilycoveCity_Text_ImArtDealer::
	.string "I'm an ART DEALER.\p"
	.string "I am a buyer and seller of fine art,\n"
	.string "especially paintings.\p"
	.string "I've heard that the MUSEUM here has\n"
	.string "magnificent works on exhibit…$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc: LilycoveCity_Text_SeaRemainsForeverYoung
Hoenn_LilycoveCity_Text_SeaRemainsForeverYoung::
	.string "Even as we grow old and wrinkled,\n"
	.string "the sea remains forever young with\l"
	.string "the vivid brilliance of life…\p"
	.string "Fwohoho fwohohohoho…$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc: LilycoveCity_Text_SixtyYearsAgoHusbandProposed
Hoenn_LilycoveCity_Text_SixtyYearsAgoHusbandProposed::
	.string "It was sixty years ago that my husband\n"
	.string "proposed to me here.\l"
	.string "The sea remains as beautiful as ever.\p"
	.string "Mufufufu mufufufufufu…$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc: LilycoveCity_Text_HoneymoonVowToSeeRarePokemon
Hoenn_LilycoveCity_Text_HoneymoonVowToSeeRarePokemon::
	.string "On our honeymoon, we vowed to see as\n"
	.string "many rare POKéMON as we can.\p"
	.string "So we were delighted to see a rare\n"
	.string "POKéMON as soon as we arrived.\p"
	.string "I mean, we are totally happy!$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc: LilycoveCity_Text_JustArrivedAndSawRarePokemon
Hoenn_LilycoveCity_Text_JustArrivedAndSawRarePokemon::
	.string "We just arrived here on our\n"
	.string "honeymoon vacation.\p"
	.string "We happened to see a DRAGON-type\n"
	.string "POKéMON flying way up in the sky.\p"
	.string "Do cool POKéMON like that live in\n"
	.string "the HOENN region?$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc: LilycoveCity_Text_HeardTowerCalledSkyPillar
Hoenn_LilycoveCity_Text_HeardTowerCalledSkyPillar::
	.string "I heard there's a tower somewhere out\n"
	.string "on the sea routes.\p"
	.string "It's called the SKY PILLAR, I hear.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc: LilycoveCity_Text_SawTallTowerOnRoute131
Hoenn_LilycoveCity_Text_SawTallTowerOnRoute131::
	.string "I saw this tall tower somewhere\n"
	.string "around ROUTE 131.\p"
	.string "Could that possibly be…?$"

